#X text 3400 4520 The no-save probe: pickup is only right when mother replayed a knobs.txt \, so this reads the file. text size 1 means it is there \, and 0 sets every slot live (item 239)., f 44;
#X text 3400 4900 Not a timing test: the push's 100 against 223 ms is an artifact. Not shell: it forks \, and is a stub on the Mac. A text read behaves the same on both., f 44;
#X text 3400 5320 The disarm is deferred by del 2000 \, because a missing file prints three lines (C-9). Nothing needs the answer until a hand touches a knob., f 44;
#X obj 3800 3620 t f;
#X obj 3800 3900 ==;
#X obj 3800 3970 ||;
#X text 3800 4640 Reaching the target is a crossing too: with the target on a rail \, value < target can never happen \, so the == releases on equality \, which is in sync by definition., f 40;
#X obj 4200 3560 t f f;
