#X text 4700 4060 The keys are an exception to the raw row \, as pressure is: a chord would evict the five-row screen (item 293) \, and an unmapped key is heard to do nothing. list fromsymbol \, split 6 \, tosymbol gives og-key for og-key-60 to og-key-84. The third outlet of list split is wired because a shorter name leaves the left one silent (C-7)., f 62;
