#X text 4600 760 CC 90 is two tiers on one button \, so it needs both edges and cannot use the spigot test: panic fires on the press \, recover after a 2000 ms hold \, and a hold raises panic twice on purpose. The table names recover \, never panic (ref/device/launchpad.md)., f 44;
