#X text 4600 2520 The breadcrumb's reading half: u_init writes recover and a stamp before the reload \, so the next boot reports it. The arming override lands at 2000 \, banging the probe's msg 4 \, so every knob is live after an emergency. The report and the clear wait until 4500 \, clear of the boot stages. Cleared by overwriting with a one-line sentinel \, since vanilla Pd cannot delete a file \; text set takes a list \, hence list none (ref/module/map.md)., f 44;
#X obj 3700 1160 unpack f f;
#X obj 3700 1230 != 0;
