#X text 20 6250 Five atoms reach the route: <dest> <arg> <value> <target> <live> \, the pickup's target and flag appended before the lookup. The loadbang seeds the target with 0 \, so a fader's message is five wide too. A button's unpack f f drops the last three \, so a button is never held., f 62;
