#X text 5180 4140 Pressure is the other exception: a name ending -at. Only the raw row is gated \, and a mapped one still draws. The test is a suffix: list length minus 3 sets list split's point first. It runs second \, off outlet 2 \, and only ever closes the spigot (item 318)., f 40;
